# -*- Perl -*-
#***********************************************************************
#
# mimedefang-filter for ml-benchmark
#
# Loaded by script/mimedefang-test-mail (driven by contrib/ml-benchmark/
# ml-benchmark): builds the Mail::MIMEDefang::ML state once per message,
# asks every configured ML backend for a verdict and appends one JSON line
# per backend to the file named by $ENV{MD_ML_BENCH_OUT}.
#
# Configured through environment variables set by ml-benchmark:
#
#   MD_ML_BENCH_OUT          result file (required)
#   MD_ML_BACKENDS           comma separated backends (laya,gliclass,openai)
#   MD_ML_TIMEOUT            seconds per HTTP request
#   MD_ML_MIN_CONFIDENCE     verdicts below this are "no opinion"
#   MD_ML_LAYA_URL           Laya server URL
#   MD_ML_GLICLASS_URL       GLiClass server URL
#   MD_ML_OPENAI_URL         OpenAI-compatible base URL
#   MD_ML_OPENAI_MODEL       OpenAI-compatible model name
#   MD_ML_OPENAI_MAX_TOKENS  max_tokens for the OpenAI backend
#   MD_ML_AUTH               1 to compute SPF/DKIM/DMARC (network lookups)
#   MD_ML_DUMP_FILE          file to write the text sent to each backend to
#
